name: Ankh — copy random joker (hold one)
author: corpus
description: >-
  Ankh creates a copy of a random Joker, then destroys all other Jokers. First-shop
  spectral copy engine: hold exactly one strong Joker so the random pick is forced.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - spectralCard: Ankh
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: TheOrder
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Cavendish
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Baron
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
